## Actionable Recommendations
1. **Target "Recent High-Value Newcomers" within 15–21 Days:** Trigger an automated post-delivery discount voucher (10–15% off second order) for recent high-spend first-time buyers before they drift into the *Hibernating* tier.
2. **Win-Back Campaign for "At-Risk Loyalists":** Send personalized re-engagement offers to customers who previously placed 2+ orders but have not purchased in 180+ days.
3. **Logistics SLA Alerts:** Flag orders at risk of missing their estimated delivery date in top revenue states (like SP, RJ, MG) and proactively notify buyers to protect post-purchase satisfaction.
